        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Surgical Site Infection Prevention Recommendations - Preoperative Period</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #1b2a63;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 1500px;\n    max-width: 100%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 60px 40px 60px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Header ---------- */\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 60px;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    font-family: \"Arial Narrow\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 62px;\n    line-height: 0.95;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n    margin: 20px 0 0 20px;\n    color: #2b3b8f;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  h1.title .orange { color: #f07f1a; }\n\n  .who-logo {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n  }\n  .who-logo .emblem {\n    width: 70px;\n    height: 70px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 2px solid #1a9ad7;\n    color: #1a9ad7;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 4px;\n  }\n  .who-logo .who-text {\n    color: #1a9ad7;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    line-height: 1.05;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Main gradient panel ---------- */\n  .panel {\n    position: relative;\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #f7f7f8 0%, #e9e9ec 45%, #d2d3d7 100%);\n    padding: 40px 20px 40px 0;\n    min-height: 1600px;\n    border-bottom: 4px solid #2b3b8f;\n  }\n\n  /* Left vertical rotated label */\n  .side-label {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 40px;\n    top: 640px;\n    transform: rotate(-90deg);\n    transform-origin: left top;\n    color: #f07f1a;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  /* Orange bracket */\n  .bracket {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 175px;\n    top: 260px;\n    bottom: 90px;\n    width: 45px;\n    border-left: 3px solid #f07f1a;\n    border-top: 3px solid #f07f1a;\n    border-bottom: 3px solid #f07f1a;\n  }\n\n  .content {\n    margin-left: 240px;\n  }\n\n  .section-head h2 {\n    font-family: \"Arial Narrow\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 38px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #2b3b8f;\n    margin: 0;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  .section-head .sub {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #2b3b8f;\n    letter-spacing: 0.2px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .col-headings {\n    display: flex;\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 20px;\n    top: 78px;\n    width: 520px;\n  }\n  .col-headings div {\n    flex: 1;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #2b3b8f;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .head-wrap { position: relative; }\n\n  /* ---------- Rows ---------- */\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #cfd0d4;\n    min-height: 190px;\n    padding: 8px 0;\n  }\n  .row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n\n  .icon-circle {\n    flex: 0 0 175px;\n    height: 175px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 3px solid #2b3b8f;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #777;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    padding: 8px;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n\n  .textbox {\n    flex: 1;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 22px;\n    margin-left: -60px;\n    padding: 22px 30px 22px 90px;\n    min-height: 150px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .textbox p {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1b2a63;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .textbox em.note {\n    display: block;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    color: #3a3f52;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .textbox i.sp { font-style: italic; }\n\n  .chevron {\n    flex: 0 0 70px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 46px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 1px #cfd0d4;\n  }\n\n  .action-col, .support-col {\n    flex: 0 0 250px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .actor {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n  }\n  .actor .caption {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1b2a63;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .actor .caption small {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .actor-group {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Placeholders ---------- */\n  .placeholder {\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\n    border: 1px dashed #b9bac0;\n    color: #8a8b92;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 2px;\n  }\n  .ph-icon { width: 150px; height: 150px; border-radius: 50%; border: none; background: transparent; }\n  .ph-figure { width: 80px; height: 95px; }\n  .ph-figure-wide { width: 150px; height: 95px; }\n  .ph-figure-tall { width: 165px; height: 130px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <h1 class=\"title\">Surgical Site Infection<br>Prevention <span class=\"orange\">Recommendations</span></h1>\n    <div class=\"who-logo\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder emblem\">[Logo: WHO emblem]</div>\n      <div class=\"who-text\">World Health<br>Organization</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"side-label\">Infection Prevention<br>and Control (IPC) Team</div>\n    <div class=\"bracket\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"head-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"section-head\">\n          <h2>Preoperative Period</h2>\n          <div class=\"sub\">Patient, clinical and support staff and surgical team actions</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-headings\">\n          <div>Action</div>\n          <div>Supported by</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Row 1 -->\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle\"><div class=\"placeholder ph-icon\">[Icon: patient showering]</div></div>\n        <div class=\"textbox\">\n          <p>Patient bathes or showers prior to surgery with either plain or antimicrobial soap</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"chevron\">&#10095;</div>\n        <div class=\"action-col\">\n          <div class=\"actor\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder ph-figure\">[Figure: patient]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">Patient</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"support-col\">\n          <div class=\"actor\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder ph-figure-tall\">[Figure group: surgical team]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">Surgical Team<br><small>At preoperative consultation</small></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Row 2 -->\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle\"><div class=\"placeholder ph-icon\">[Icon: ointment tube and nose]</div></div>\n        <div class=\"textbox\">\n          <p>Use 2% mupirocin decolonization in known nasal carriers of <i class=\"sp\">Staphylococcus aureus</i> in cardiac and orthopaedic surgery\n            <em class=\"note\">(consider for other surgeries)</em>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"chevron\">&#10095;</div>\n        <div class=\"action-col\">\n          <div class=\"actor\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder ph-figure\">[Figure: nurse]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">Ward Nurse</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"support-col\">\n          <div class=\"actor-group\">\n            <div class=\"actor\">\n              <div class=\"placeholder ph-figure\">[Figure: doctor]</div>\n              <div class=\"caption\">Doctor</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"actor\">\n              <div class=\"placeholder ph-figure\">[Icon: medicine box]</div>\n              <div class=\"caption\">Pharmacy</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Row 3 -->\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle\"><div class=\"placeholder ph-icon\">[Icon: razor with red X]</div></div>\n        <div class=\"textbox\">\n          <p>Do NOT remove patient hair, or if absolutely necessary, remove with a clipper, do not shave</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"chevron\">&#10095;</div>\n        <div class=\"action-col\">\n          <div class=\"actor\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder ph-figure-wide\">[Figure group: two clinicians]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">Surgical Team</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"support-col\">\n          <div class=\"actor\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder ph-figure\">[Figure: person reading booklet]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">Patient Information<br>and Education</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Row 4 -->\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle\"><div class=\"placeholder ph-icon\">[Icon: clock]</div></div>\n        <div class=\"textbox\">\n          <p>Administer surgical antibiotic prophylaxis in the 120 minutes preceding surgical incision\n            <em class=\"note\">(depending on the type of operation and the half life of the antibiotic)</em>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"chevron\">&#10095;</div>\n        <div class=\"action-col\">\n          <div class=\"actor\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder ph-figure\">[Figure: clinician with syringe]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">Anaesthetist<br><small>(or other in surgical team)</small></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"support-col\">\n          <div class=\"actor\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder ph-figure-wide\">[Figure group: two staff with medicine box]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">IPC Team/Pharmacy</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Row 5 -->\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"icon-circle\"><div class=\"placeholder ph-icon\">[Icon: soap dispenser and hands]</div></div>\n        <div class=\"textbox\">\n          <p>Prepare hands for surgery by scrubbing, using the correct technique with a suitable antimicrobial soap and water OR an alcohol-based handrub\n            <em class=\"note\">(before donning sterile gloves)</em>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"chevron\">&#10095;</div>\n        <div class=\"action-col\">\n          <div class=\"actor\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder ph-figure\">[Figure: surgeon]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">Surgeon</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"support-col\">\n          <div class=\"actor\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder ph-figure-wide\">[Icons: medicine box and cartons]</div>\n            <div class=\"caption\">Pharmacy/<br>Procurement</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
